Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:15:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(evm): add Hemi default stablecoins

Add Hemi mainnet (eip155:43111) and Hemi Testnet (eip155:743111) to the
EVM default asset tables of the TypeScript, Go and Python SDKs, with
USDC.e as the default stablecoin, and the v1 network names hemi and
hemi-testnet. Without a default asset, "$0.01" pricing throws on Hemi and
client spend controls reject Hemi USDC.e.

Mainnet USDC.e supports EIP-3009 (EIP-712 domain "Bridged USDC
(Stargate)", version "2"). The testnet token has neither EIP-3009 nor
EIP-2612, so it uses Permit2, as Igra's entry does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
